# FEEL-4 / known finding: South has a double tap (B) and a long press (C). A long press that is
# released fires C at once and nothing else; a tap after a long press is a single tap and waits out
# the double-tap window; a press held 300 ms (shorter than a long press) then released fires its tap
# only after the double-tap window.
setup tests/scenarios/packs/input.padpack Gestures
press south
advance 600
release south
advance 400
tap south 30
advance 400
press south
advance 300
release south
advance 400
---
key KEY_C down @500
key KEY_C up   @600
key KEY_A down @1280
key KEY_A up   @1280
key KEY_A down @1980
key KEY_A up   @1980
